#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[Dirichlet Type of Species]

Given a species $F$ define the _$Gamma$-dirichlet type_ of $F$ by
$
  D_F^Gamma (S) :-= sum_(A: "FinSet") sum_(y : F(A)) (S -> B Gamma(A,y)),
$

for some section $Gamma$
$
  Gamma : product_(A : "FinSet") F(A) -> sum_(G : "Group") (U G ~= A),
$
with $U G$ denoting the underlying type of $G$. In other words, $Gamma$ should equip each finite set $A$ with $F$-structure $y$ with a group structure. 
